  "interpretation": [
    "Semantic roles map onto existing TaCZ attachment slots: effects to grip, modifiers to stock, delivery triggers to muzzle, capacity to extended_mag.",
    "Normal logic explicitly disables manual reload and models a rechargeable reserve using TaCZ magazine APIs; this is not proof of an Ars Source or AoA Spirit bridge.",
    "Double-fire and spread modifiers alter delivery as well as costs; they need explicit resource and successful-shot semantics in AoA.",
    "All eight display resources name LODs; presence is not a measured performance result.",
    "Flying-blade presentation has six named blade groups and distinct actions; do not infer melee or homing behavior from appearance."
